# FINAL FANTASY IX (Japan): the kanji of each place's own font. A place is known by a hash of its font's glyph
# list and its messages' records (the script's place_key); a line is a code's number in that font, in hex
# (0xFC 03 is 03), and its kanji. Read off the place's glyph pictures and checked by reading its messages decoded
# with them; a glyph whose reading stayed in doubt is left out.
